{"seq":1,"slug":"linehaul-node-transit-track","title":"国际段节点与干线时效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/linehaul-ops-exception/linehaul-node-transit-track","wordCount":2200,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"国际段节点与干线时效\">国际段节点与干线时效</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>国际干线运输最难的部分不是运，而是<strong>知道货在哪</strong>。一条头程链路要经过工厂、内陆运输、起运港码头、船司、目的港码头、清关行、内陆运输、目的仓这么多个外部主体，每一段的状态分散在各自的系统里，格式与更新频率都不一致。卖家拿到的往往是滞后的、片段的信息，而决策（是否改配、是否转海外仓、是否告警客户）必须基于这些信息做出。</p>\n<p>解决这个问题的工程手段是<strong>节点建模</strong>——把整条链路的连续性状态，离散成一组有明确语义的节点，并为每个节点定义&quot;进入条件、预期时长、超时判据&quot;。节点建模的价值在于<strong>可对比</strong>：只有定义了一致的节点，才能把不同航次、不同承运商的时效放在同一张表上比较，才能算出&quot;哪个节点是瓶颈&quot;。</p>\n<p>节点建模的第二个价值是<strong>可推演</strong>。外部只上报有限的几个事件（如&quot;已装船&quot;&quot;已到港&quot;），但业务需要知道中间每一刻的状态。因此在离散的上报之间，系统要通过<strong>状态推演</strong>补全——按已知的航期与历史数据估算当前位置与预计到达时间。这正是可见性系统与简单的&quot;查物流&quot;之间的差别。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; AtOrigin: 工厂交货&#10;  AtOrigin --&gt; InlandToPort: 内陆运输&#10;  InlandToPort --&gt; AtOriginPort: 到达起运港&#10;  AtOriginPort --&gt; CustomsExport: 出口报关&#10;  CustomsExport --&gt; LoadedOnVessel: 装船&#10;  LoadedOnVessel --&gt; InTransit: 海上在途&#10;  InTransit --&gt; Transshipment: 中转港&#10;  Transshipment --&gt; InTransit: 二程船&#10;  InTransit --&gt; AtDestPort: 到达目的港&#10;  AtDestPort --&gt; CustomsImport: 进口清关&#10;  CustomsImport --&gt; Discharged: 放行提柜&#10;  Discharged --&gt; InlandDelivery: 内陆派送&#10;  InlandDelivery --&gt; AtWarehouse: 到达目的仓&#10;  AtWarehouse --&gt; [*]&#10;  InTransit --&gt; Delayed: 延误&#10;  Delayed --&gt; InTransit: 恢复\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; AtOrigin: 工厂交货\n  AtOrigin --&gt; InlandToPort: 内陆运输\n  InlandToPort --&gt; AtOriginPort: 到达起运港\n  AtOriginPort --&gt; CustomsExport: 出口报关\n  CustomsExport --&gt; LoadedOnVessel: 装船\n  LoadedOnVessel --&gt; InTransit: 海上在途\n  InTransit --&gt; Transshipment: 中转港\n  Transshipment --&gt; InTransit: 二程船\n  InTransit --&gt; AtDestPort: 到达目的港\n  AtDestPort --&gt; CustomsImport: 进口清关\n  CustomsImport --&gt; Discharged: 放行提柜\n  Discharged --&gt; InlandDelivery: 内陆派送\n  InlandDelivery --&gt; AtWarehouse: 到达目的仓\n  AtWarehouse --&gt; [*]\n  InTransit --&gt; Delayed: 延误\n  Delayed --&gt; InTransit: 恢复</pre><h2 id=\"节点定义与数据来源\">节点定义与数据来源</h2><p>节点建模的第一步是定义节点清单，并为每个节点指定<strong>权威数据源</strong>。下表是一个可直接落地的节点定义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>权威数据源</th>\n<th>典型时长</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>装船（Loaded）</td>\n<td>柜子已上船</td>\n<td>船司/码头</td>\n<td>事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途（InTransit）</td>\n<td>航行中</td>\n<td>船司船期</td>\n<td>视航线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中转（Transshipment）</td>\n<td>在中转港换船</td>\n<td>船司</td>\n<td>3–10 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到港（AtDestPort）</td>\n<td>抵达目的港</td>\n<td>码头/船司</td>\n<td>事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关中（CustomsImport）</td>\n<td>报关受理</td>\n<td>报关行/海关</td>\n<td>1–5 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放行（Released）</td>\n<td>海关放行</td>\n<td>海关</td>\n<td>事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提柜（PickedUp）</td>\n<td>卡车提走重柜</td>\n<td>卡车行</td>\n<td>事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到达（AtWarehouse）</td>\n<td>抵达目的仓</td>\n<td>仓库 ASN 收货</td>\n<td>事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么每个节点必须有唯一权威源\">为什么每个节点必须有唯一权威源</h3><p>两个数据源报同一个节点会产生冲突——船司说&quot;已到港&quot;，码头系统说&quot;未卸船&quot;。有唯一权威源就不必在各源之间做仲裁：<strong>该节点以谁的报为准，事先定死</strong>。这不是技术问题而是治理问题，但它的缺失会让可见性系统陷入无休止的争议。</p>\n<h3 id=\"中转节点为什么要单独建模\">中转节点为什么要单独建模</h3><p>中转（Transshipment）是时效波动最大的节点，因为货物要在中转港从一条船换到另一条船，等待时间取决于两条船的班期衔接。把它合并进&quot;在途&quot;会掩盖这个波动——一条直达航线与一条中转两次的航线，在&quot;在途&quot;这一个状态上看起来没差别，但实际时效可能差两周。因此中转必须作为独立节点，且要记录中转港与前后程船名。</p>\n<p>节点建模还应覆盖<strong>码头环节本身</strong>。集装箱码头是&quot;在不同运输工具之间转运集装箱的设施&quot;，到达的箱子在堆场堆存，装上/卸下由岸桥完成，再由火车、卡车或驳船疏运；重箱在堆场等待后续运输，空箱则可能停留更久等待再次使用（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Container_terminal\">Container terminal</a>）。这说明&quot;在码头&quot;不是一个瞬时状态而是一段有明确物理原因的停留，把它建模成独立节点，才能把码头停留时长从其他段里分出来考查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时效指标-从-到了吗-到-慢在哪\">时效指标：从&quot;到了吗&quot;到&quot;慢在哪&quot;</h2><p>有了统一的节点，才能计算有意义的时效指标。最基本的一组是<strong>分段时效</strong>——把总时效拆成几段，逐段与基准比较：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>origin</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>linehaul</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>customs</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>delivery</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}} = T_{\\text{origin}} + T_{\\text{linehaul}} + T_{\\text{customs}} + T_{\\text{delivery}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">origin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">linehaul</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">delivery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>origin</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{origin}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">origin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是起运段（工厂到装船），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>linehaul</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{linehaul}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">linehaul</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是在途（含中转），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>customs</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{customs}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是清关，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>delivery</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{delivery}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">delivery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目的港到仓。逐段对比基准，就能定位瓶颈在哪一段，而不是只知道&quot;慢了 8 天&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分段时效</td>\n<td>相邻节点的时间差</td>\n<td>定位瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计划 vs 实际偏差</td>\n<td>实际到达 − 计划到达</td>\n<td>单票异常判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P50 / P90 时效</td>\n<td>分位数</td>\n<td>基准设定、客户承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效达成率</td>\n<td>在承诺期内到达的比例</td>\n<td>承运商考核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么要用-p90-而不是平均值\">为什么要用 P90 而不是平均值</h3><p>干线时效的分布是<strong>右偏</strong>的——大部分货准时或小延误，少数货严重延误。平均值会掩盖这个尾部，导致承诺给客户的时效过于乐观。用 P90（或 P80）作为承诺依据，能让绝大多数货达成承诺，同时把尾部的风险显性化。承运商的考核同样应当看 P90 而不只是达成率，因为达成率可以通过牺牲少数货来优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态推演-在上报之间补全位置\">状态推演：在上报之间补全位置</h2><p>外部上报是稀疏的（可能几天一次），但业务几乎每时每刻都想知道货在哪。状态推演的作用是在两次上报之间，用已知信息估算当前位置与预计到达时间。</p>\n<p>推演的基本方法是<strong>按航期线性插值加历史缓冲</strong>：已知装船时间与预计到港时间，当前时刻按比例估算航行进度；但实际的到达分布是右偏的，因此预计到达日应当用该航线该船司的历史 P90 偏差来修正，而不是直接用船司的 ETA。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def estimate_arrival(etd, carrier_eta, now, history):&#10;    base_transit = (carrier_eta - etd).days&#10;    p90_transit = history[&quot;p90_transit_days&quot;]&#10;    expected = etd + timedelta(days=p90_transit)&#10;    elapsed = (now - etd).days&#10;    progress = min(elapsed / max(p90_transit, 1), 1.0)&#10;    return {&#10;        &quot;carrier_eta&quot;: carrier_eta,&#10;        &quot;expected_eta&quot;: expected,&#10;        &quot;risk_delta_days&quot;: p90_transit - base_transit,&#10;        &quot;progress&quot;: round(progress, 3),&#10;        &quot;is_late_risk&quot;: expected &gt; carrier_eta,&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> estimate_arrival</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(etd, carrier_eta, now, history):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    base_transit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (carrier_eta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> etd).days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p90_transit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> history[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p90_transit_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> etd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p90_transit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> etd).days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    progress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p90_transit, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"carrier_eta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: carrier_eta,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"expected_eta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: expected,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"risk_delta_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p90_transit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_transit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"progress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(progress, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"is_late_risk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_eta,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"推演必须暴露不确定性\">推演必须暴露不确定性</h3><p>上例中 <code>risk_delta_days</code> 与 <code>is_late_risk</code> 是推演的关键输出——它们把&quot;船司说 20 天到、但这条航线 P90 是 26 天&quot;这个矛盾显性化。没有这两个字段，推演就只是把船司的 ETA 原样显示，失去了独立判断的价值。有了它们，下游的排程（如 <a href=\"../fba-warehouse-inbound/fba-shipment-inbound-appointment\">FBA 入库货件与预约</a> 里的 <code>slack_days</code>）才能用保守值而非乐观值做判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件摄取与幂等\">事件摄取与幂等</h2><p>可见性系统的输入是外部事件流——船司 API 推送、码头 EDI 报文、货代邮件解析、人工录入。这些事件有几个共同特点：<strong>乱序到达</strong>（中转事件可能早于装船事件到达）、<strong>重复</strong>（同一事件被多次推送）、<strong>格式不一</strong>。</p>\n<p>处置这三个特点需要在事件摄取层做三件事：<strong>以事件发生时间而非接收时间排序</strong>（应对乱序）、<strong>以事件唯一标识去重</strong>（应对重复）、<strong>归一化为统一的节点事件结构</strong>（应对格式差异）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;node_event&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;event_id&quot;: &quot;carrierA:EX1234567:loaded:2026-09-14T08:22:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;shipment_ref&quot;: &quot;BK-CNSHA-USLAX-20260927-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;container_no&quot;: &quot;EXAMPLE1234567&quot;,&#10;    &quot;node&quot;: &quot;LoadedOnVessel&quot;,&#10;    &quot;occurred_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-14T08:22:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;received_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-14T11:40:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;source&quot;: &quot;carrier_api&quot;,&#10;    &quot;authoritative&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;payload&quot;: { &quot;vessel_voyage&quot;: &quot;MV EXAMPLE / 26E&quot;, &quot;port&quot;: &quot;CNSHA&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"node_event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"event_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"carrierA:EX1234567:loaded:2026-09-14T08:22:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"shipment_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BK-CNSHA-USLAX-20260927-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"container_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EXAMPLE1234567\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LoadedOnVessel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"occurred_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-14T08:22:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"received_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-14T11:40:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"carrier_api\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"authoritative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"payload\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"vessel_voyage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MV EXAMPLE / 26E\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"port\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CNSHA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"event_id-的构造规则\">event_id 的构造规则</h3><p><code>event_id</code> 必须由<strong>来源 + 业务主键 + 节点 + 发生时间</strong>组合而成，而不是用来源系统内部的记录 ID。原因是不同来源的 ID 空间不重叠，且部分来源（如邮件解析）根本没有 ID。用组合键构造的 event_id 天然具备幂等性——同一事件无论被推送几次，ID 都相同，去重即完成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件乱序为什么不能靠-丢弃旧事件-解决\">事件乱序为什么不能靠&quot;丢弃旧事件&quot;解决</h3><p>一个常见的错误实现是&quot;只保留最新事件&quot;，这会在乱序时丢失正确状态。正确的做法是<strong>以 <code>occurred_at</code> 为准做状态回放</strong>——把容器对应的所有事件按发生时间排序，依次应用到状态机上。这样无论事件以什么顺序到达，最终状态都是一致的。这与事件溯源（Event Sourcing）的核心思想相同：状态是事件的函数，而非可覆盖的字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>干线可见性的第一步是<strong>节点建模</strong>：把连续状态离散为语义明确的节点，每个节点指定唯一权威数据源，避免多源冲突仲裁。</li>\n<li>中转（Transshipment）必须单独建模，因为它是时效波动最大的节点，合并进&quot;在途&quot;会掩盖直达与中转航线的真实差异。</li>\n<li>时效指标应<strong>分段计算</strong>（起运 / 在途 / 清关 / 派送）以定位瓶颈；承诺与考核应基于 <strong>P90</strong> 而非平均值，因为时效分布右偏。</li>\n<li>状态推演要在稀疏上报之间补全位置，并用<strong>历史 P90 偏差</strong>修正船司 ETA，同时显式输出 <code>risk_delta_days</code> 与 <code>is_late_risk</code>，供下游用保守值排程。</li>\n<li>事件摄取要处理乱序、重复、格式不一：<code>event_id</code> 由来源+业务主键+节点+发生时间组合构造以天然幂等，状态按 <code>occurred_at</code> 回放而非&quot;只保留最新&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"国际段节点与干线时效","id":"国际段节点与干线时效"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"节点定义与数据来源","id":"节点定义与数据来源"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么每个节点必须有唯一权威源","id":"为什么每个节点必须有唯一权威源"},{"level":3,"text":"中转节点为什么要单独建模","id":"中转节点为什么要单独建模"},{"level":2,"text":"时效指标：从\"到了吗\"到\"慢在哪\"","id":"时效指标-从-到了吗-到-慢在哪"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要用 P90 而不是平均值","id":"为什么要用-p90-而不是平均值"},{"level":2,"text":"状态推演：在上报之间补全位置","id":"状态推演-在上报之间补全位置"},{"level":3,"text":"推演必须暴露不确定性","id":"推演必须暴露不确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"事件摄取与幂等","id":"事件摄取与幂等"},{"level":3,"text":"event_id 的构造规则","id":"event_id-的构造规则"},{"level":3,"text":"事件乱序为什么不能靠\"丢弃旧事件\"解决","id":"事件乱序为什么不能靠-丢弃旧事件-解决"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"外箱标签与入仓合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/fba-warehouse-inbound/carton-label-compliance-inbound"},"next":{"title":"甩柜/舱位异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/linehaul-ops-exception/rolled-shipment-capacity-exc"}}